easoning\":\"The acceptance standard requires a fresh verifier pass before story-lead acceptance; the latest bounded child response satisfies that condition.\"},{\"name\":\"Story requirements coverage\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"018-verify.json lists AC-1.1, AC-1.2, AC-1.3, AC-1.4 and TC-1.1a through TC-1.4b under verified, with no unverified requirements.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Under ruling 012, Story 1 is judged on primitive append/read evidence, taxonomy validation, ordering, idempotency, related-id storage, and bounded page shape only.\"},{\"name\":\"Prior blocker resolution\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"018-verify.json marks S1-F3 resolved, citing restored appendArchiveEntry and listArchiveEntries exports in convex/archiveEntries.ts.\",\"018-verify.json confirms the focused Story 1 suite passed.\"],\"reasoning\":\"The only open blocking finding from the prior verifier result has been verified as resolved.\"},{\"name\":\"Story gate\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"018-verify.json reports corepack pnpm run green-verify passed.\",\"018-verify.json reports the targeted command corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node passed.\"],\"reasoning\":\"The configured story gate truth is green in the latest verifier evidence.\"}],\"callerInputHistory\":{\"reviewRequests\":[],\"rulings\":[{\"rulingRequestId\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001-ruling-012\",\"decision\":\"primitive-only evidence is sufficient; defer TC-1.1/TC-1.4 service/API proof\",\"rationale\":\"Story 1's scoped ownership is the canonical archive-entry persistence primitive only. The story, test plan, and tech design have been aligned so service-level finalization proof belongs to Story 2 and read-time artifact/source enrichment plus lookup-failure degradation semantics belong to Stories 3 and 6. Story 1 should therefore be judged on primitive append/read evidence, taxonomy validation, ordering, idempotency, related-id storage, and bounded page shape only.\",\"source\":\"impl-lead\"}]},\"runtimeIdentity\":{\"version\":\"0.4.0\",\"invocationSource\":\"unknown\",\"entryPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/lspec-core/dist/bin/lbuild-impl.js\"},\"replayBoundary\":null,\"logHandoff\":{\"recommendedState\":\"STORY_BLOCKED\",\"recommendedCurrentStory\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\",\"recommendedCurrentPhase\":\"story-orchestrate\",\"continuationHandles\":{\"storyImplementor\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019df60d-fe28-78c2-89a0-54aa6e77481e\",\"storyId\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\"},\"storyVerifier\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019df617-f545-7c12-973a-19e600231531\",\"storyId\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\"}},\"storyReceiptDraft\":{\"storyId\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\",\"storyTitle\":\"Story 1: Canonical Archive Entry Persistence\",\"implementorEvidenceRefs\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/004-implementor.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/015-continue.json\"],\"verifierEvidenceRefs\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/014-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/018-verify.json\"],\"gateCommand\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"gateResult\":\"fail\",\"dispositions\":[{\"id\":\"S1-F1\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":[\"014-verify.json resolved S1-F1 after impl-lead ruling 012 aligned Story 1 to primitive-only evidence.\",\"018-v