{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018pkqsaddBrKr63mqNtZtwV","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! I now have a comprehensive view of the Epic 7 implementation. Let me compile the complete report of all files read.\n\n## Comprehensive Epic 7 Implementation Review\n\nI have thoroughly reviewed all the files implementing Epic 7 (Archive and Derived Views) in the Liminal Build platform. Here's a complete summary of the implementation:\n\n---\n\n### **CONVEX FILES**\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/convex/archiveEntries.ts`\nImplements the core archive entry management in Convex. Key features:\n- `appendArchiveEntry` mutation: Creates finalized archive entries with strict validation\n- `listArchiveEntries` query: Pagination of archive entries by process with sequence-based ordering\n- `patchArchiveEntry` mutation: Updates archive entry metadata (artifact versions, provenance IDs, status)\n- Automatic cache invalidation for derived archive turns and views when entries are modified\n- Validators for 7 supported entry kinds: user_message, model_message, reasoning, script_emission, tool_call, tool_result, process_event\n- Supports 4 body formats: plain_text, markdown, structured (JSON), none\n- Entry status tracking: ready or degraded with degradation reasons\n- Idempotent append via finalization key deduplication\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/convex/archiveTurns.ts`\nManages derived turn abstractions over archive entries. Features:\n- `upsertArchiveTurns` mutation: Replaces the entire turn collection for a process\n- `listArchiveTurns` query: Pagination of turns with turn index-based cursor\n- Each turn groups related archive entries (user messages initiate turns, tool results backfill to tool calls)\n- Turn status derives from constituent entry statuses\n- Automatic invalidation of derived archive views when turns change\n- Up to 100 turns per page\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/convex/derivedArchiveViews.ts`\nImplements two kinds of derived views: turn_range and chunk_candidate. Features:\n- `replaceDerivedArchiveViews` (internal) and `replaceDerivedArchiveViewsForService` (API-key protected) mutations\n- `listDerivedArchiveViews` (internal) and `listDerivedArchiveViewsForService` (API-key protected) queries\n- View kinds: turn_range (single or multiple turns), chunk_candidate (grouped turns for chunking)\n- Pagination with offset-based cursor, max 50 views per page\n- All views track source turns and archive entries for traceability\n- Status propagation and degradation reason aggregation\n\n---\n\n### **SHARED CONTRACTS**\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/shared/contracts/archive.ts`\nCentral Zod schema definitions for the entire archive subsystem:\n- **Archive entry schemas**: Complete validation of all 7 entry kinds with conditional validations\n- **Archive page schemas**: Pagination with cursor and hasMore flags\n- **Derived turn schemas**: Turn index, timing, degradation metadata\n- **Derived archive view schemas**: View kind validation, turn range constraints\n- **Error codes**: ARCHIVE_DERIVATION_CONFLICT (409), INVALID_ARCHIVE_REQUEST (422)\n- **Route patterns**: API endpoints for archive, turns, derived views, and refresh operations\n- **Body format support**: plain_text, markdown, structured (with jsonText), none\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/shared/contracts/process-work-surface.ts`\nExtended with archive-related additions (ProcessHistoryItemKind, EnvironmentState references). The file shows integration of archive concepts into the broader process work surface.\n\n---\n\n### **SERVER SCHEMAS & ROUTES**\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/schemas/archive.ts`\nFastify route schemas:\n- GET `/api/projects/{projectId}/processes/{processId}/archive` - List archive entries\n- GET `/api/projects/{projectId}/processes/{processId}/archive/turns` - List derived turns\n- GET `/api/projects/{projectId}/processes/{processId}/archive/derived-views` - List derived views\n- POST `/api/projects/{projectId}/processes/{processId}/archive/derived-views/refresh` - Refresh views\n- Shell route: GET `/projects/{projectId}/processes/{processId}/archive` for rendering UI\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/routes/archive.ts`\nHTTP route handlers for all archive endpoints:\n- Authentication checks with session validation\n- Process access verification before exposing archive data\n- Service delegation to ArchiveReadService, TurnDerivationService, DerivedArchiveViewService\n- Proper error responses with 401 (unauthenticated), 403 (forbidden), 404 (not found), 409 (conflict), 422 (invalid)\n- Shell document rendering for the archive UI\n\n---\n\n### **SERVER SERVICES**\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-read.service.ts`\nReads and enriches archive entries:\n- Validates process access before returning entries\n- Normalizes pagination parameters (limit 1-200, default 100)\n- Calls `enrichArchiveEntries` to add provenance metadata (artifact versions, source provenance)\n- Returns zod-validated ArchivePage responses\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-finalization.service.ts`\nBridges legacy process history to the archive:\n- `appendFinalizedEntry`: Strict validation for entries requiring sourceObjectId\n- `appendFromProcessHistoryItem`: Maps 3 compatible history kinds (user_message, model_message, process_event) to archive\n- Deduplicates user_message entries by sourceObjectId\n- Handles body format detection and null-coalescing for optional fields\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/services/archive/turn-derivation.service.ts`\nDerives turn abstractions from archive entries:\n- `rebuildTurns`: Reconstructs turns by analyzing entry sequence\n- Turn logic: User messages initiate turns; subsequent entries attach to active turn until next user message\n- Tool result backfill: Attempts to correlate results with tool calls by relatedToolCallId\n- Degradation tracking: Records missing correlations, missing timestamps, etc.\n- `getTurns`: Lazy initialization with cache warming on first access\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/services/archive/derived-archive-view.service.ts`\nBuilds and refreshes structural views:\n- `listViews`: Lazy turn-to-view derivation on first access\n- `refreshViews`: Rebuilds turns then views, with archive signature validation to detect concurrent mutations\n- View types: One turn_range view per turn + chunk candidates (groups of 2 turns)\n- Label generation based on turn ranges and view kind\n- Status propagation from constituent turns\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-entry-enrichment.ts`\nEnriches archive entries with related metadata:\n- Batches artifact version lookups to avoid N+1 queries\n- Loads producing process display labels for artifact context\n- Fetches source provenance entries by provenanceId\n- Degrades gracefully when related records are missing\n- Returns entries with optional `relatedArtifactProvenance` and `relatedSourceProvenance` fields\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/services/archive/process-history-compat.service.ts`\nCompatibility layer for legacy process history:\n- Maps 3 history kinds to archive: user_message, process_message→model_message, process_event\n- Builds finalization keys scoped by entry kind (response:, model:, event:, history:)\n- Detects body format from text presence\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts`\nExtended with archive methods (6 new interface methods + implementation):\n- `appendArchiveEntry`, `patchArchiveEntry`, `listArchiveEntries`\n- `upsertArchiveTurns`, `listArchiveTurns`\n- `replaceDerivedArchiveViews`, `listDerivedArchiveViews`\n- Both ConvexPlatformStore (delegates to Convex mutations/queries) and InMemoryPlatformStore (test doubles) implementations\n- Type exports: `ArchiveEntryWriteInput`, `ArchiveEntryPatchInput`\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/services/processes/environment/process-environment.service.ts`\n(Modified) Integrates archive finalization:\n- Calls `ArchiveFinalizationService` to archive finalized process history items\n- Maintains backward compatibility with existing environment management\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/services/processes/process-response.service.ts`\n(Modified) Archives submitted user responses:\n- Appends user messages to archive when responses are submitted\n- Uses finalization service for consistency\n\n---\n\n### **CLIENT FEATURES**\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/client/features/processes/archive-section.ts`\nRenders the archive entries section:\n- Lists all finalized archive entries with proper sequencing\n- Shows entry kind, body content, timestamps, status\n- Displays optional artifact provenance (version label, producing process)\n- Displays optional source provenance (repository, target ref)\n- Renders degradation reasons for degraded entries\n- Pagination state indicator with \"more available\" flag\n- Safe text content with data attributes for CSS targeting\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/client/features/processes/archive-turns-section.ts`\nRenders the derived turns section:\n- Shows turn boundaries by turnIndex\n- Lists archive entry IDs in each turn\n- Displays timestamp ranges (startedAt → endedAt)\n- Renders degradation metadata for degraded turns\n- Pagination state with \"more available\" flag\n- Clean HTML structure with data attributes\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/client/features/processes/derived-archive-views-section.ts`\nRenders the structural views section:\n- Turn range visualization (e.g., \"Turns 0-1\" vs \"Turn 0\")\n- Chunk candidate labeling (\"Chunk candidate turn X\")\n- Shows source turn IDs and archive entry IDs with proper dedupe\n- Displays optional title and body text\n- Error state rendering with alert role\n- Pagination state with granular view counts\n- Degradation reason display for degraded views\n\n---\n\n### **TESTS**\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/fixtures/archive.ts`\nComprehensive test fixtures covering all scenarios:\n- One fixture per entry kind (7 total)\n- Degraded entry example\n- Entries with artifact and source provenance enrichment\n- Turn fixtures (ready and degraded)\n- Derived view fixtures (turn_range and chunk_candidate, including degraded)\n- Full page responses and error payloads\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/convex/archiveEntries.test.ts`\nVitest specs for Convex mutations (21 test cases):\n- Entry kind validation (TC-1.2a/b)\n- Sequence assignment and ordering (TC-1.3a/b)\n- Replay idempotency (TC-2.3b)\n- Related context storage and handling (TC-1.4a/b)\n- Archive preservation during turn/view derivation (TC-4.3a, TC-5.4a)\n- Service API wrapper authentication (test-convex-api-key requirement)\n- Atomic sequence assignment per-process\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts`\nIntegration tests for HTTP archive endpoints (partial):\n- Authentication and session handling\n- Process access verification\n- Archive entry enrichment with provenance\n- Error responses and status codes\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts`\nTests archive finalization boundary logic:\n- Progress updates excluded from archive (TC-2.1a)\n- Interrupted model output excluded (TC-2.2a)\n- Incomplete tool results validation (TC-2.2b)\n- Live object archival through finalization service (TC-2.3a)\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/service/server/turn-derivation.test.ts`\nTests turn derivation algorithm and HTTP turns endpoint:\n- User message turn initiation\n- Tool call/result correlation\n- Degradation tracking for missing correlations\n- Lazy turn cache warming on first API access\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/service/server/derived-archive-view.test.ts`\nTests derived view creation and refresh:\n- Turn-range and chunk-candidate view generation\n- Archive signature validation (prevents unsafe refresh during mutations)\n- View label generation\n- Degradation propagation from constituent turns\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts`\nJSDOM tests for archive rendering:\n- Route path building (shell and API routes)\n- Archive entry kind validation\n- Error code and status mapping\n- Schema validation for all entry types\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/service/client/archive-turns-section.test.ts`\nJSDOM tests for turn rendering:\n- Turn boundary visualization\n- Archive entry reference listing\n- Degradation metadata display\n- Pagination state indication\n\n#### `/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/service/client/derived-archive-views.test.ts`\nJSDOM tests for derived views:\n- View kind-specific labeling\n- Pagination and loading states\n- Error state rendering\n- Archive entry provenance traceability\n\n---\n\n### **KEY ARCHITECTURAL DECISIONS**\n\n1. **Three-layer archive abstraction**:\n   - Layer 1: Archive entries (finalized, immutable, sequenced)\n   - Layer 2: Derived turns (group entries by conversation rounds)\n   - Layer 3: Derived views (structural organization for chunking/navigation)\n\n2. **Idempotent entry append**: Finalization keys prevent duplicates on replay\n\n3. **Lazy view derivation**: Turns and views are rebuilt on first read if stale, reducing write latency\n\n4. **Archive signature validation**: Prevents unsafe derived view refresh if archive changed concurrently\n\n5. **Graceful degradation**: Missing provenance records don't break rendering; degradation reasons explain data quality issues\n\n6. **Service API authentication**: Convex derived view mutations require CONVEX_API_KEY validation\n\n7. **Provenance enrichment**: Artifact and source metadata is populated post-hoc via separate service calls\n\n---\n\nAll files are fully implemented, tested, and integrated into the platform's process archive, turn derivation, and structural view subsystems."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ceb8cd2b-35ba-478c-a9f5-82f59e9dd21d","uuid":"cdf880ab-7164-4ae0-952b-85695dc7fad8","timestamp":"2026-05-05T23:32:04.409Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"I'm reviewing the implementation of Epic 7 (Archive and Derived Views) in a Liminal Build platform codebase at /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build. I need a comprehensive read of all the new and modified files added for this epic. The tech design specifies these paths:\n\n**Convex files:**\n- convex/archiveEntries.ts\n- convex/archiveTurns.ts\n- convex/derivedArchiveViews.ts\n- convex/schema.ts (modified, archive tables)\n\n**Shared contracts:**\n- apps/platform/shared/contracts/archive.ts\n- apps/platform/shared/contracts/process-work-surface.ts (modified)\n\n**Server:**\n- apps/platform/server/schemas/archive.ts\n- apps/platform/server/routes/archive.ts\n- apps/platform/server/services/archive/ (entire directory)\n- apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts (modified)\n- apps/platform/server/services/processes/environment/process-environment.service.ts (modified)\n- apps/platform/server/services/processes/process-response.service.ts (modified)\n\n**Client:**\n- apps/platform/client/features/processes/archive-section.ts\n- apps/platform/client/features/processes/archive-turns-section.ts\n- apps/platform/client/features/processes/derived-archive-views-section.ts\n\n**Tests:**\n- tests/fixtures/archive.ts\n- tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts\n- tests/service/